---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import GoogleBusinessInfo from '../../components/GoogleBusinessInfo.astro';

const title = 'Drain Cleaning in Mason City, IA | A-1 Drain Cleaning';
const description = 'Need drain cleaning in Mason City, Iowa? A-1 Drain Cleaning handles clogged drains, basement floor backups, main drains and sewer lines. Call 641-530-2728.';
---

<MainLayout title={title} description={description} path="/mason-city-drain-cleaning/">
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-[#1A1A68] text-white">
      <div class="container grid gap-10 py-14 sm:py-18 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] lg:items-center lg:py-20">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-300">A-1 Drain Cleaning • Mason City, Iowa</p>
          <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black leading-[.98] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Drain Cleaning in Mason City, Iowa</h1>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-200 sm:text-xl">A-1 Drain Cleaning is based in Mason City and cleans and unclogs drains, main drains, floor drains, and sewer lines for local homes and businesses.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate-200">If one sink is slow, several fixtures are backing up, or wastewater is coming up through a floor drain, tell us what the water is doing. That pattern helps identify where to start.</p>
          <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-7 py-4 text-center text-lg font-black text-white hover:bg-[#a82129]">CALL 641-530-2728</a>
          <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">24/7 drain and sewer service • Based in Mason City, Iowa</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="border border-white/15 bg-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8" aria-labelledby="mason-city-problem">
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-red-200">Start with the symptom</p>
          <h2 id="mason-city-problem" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight">What is the drain doing?</h2>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-slate-200">
            <li class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4"><strong class="text-white">One sink, tub, or shower:</strong> slow or completely stopped.</li>
            <li class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4"><strong class="text-white">Several fixtures:</strong> more than one drain backs up or gurgles.</li>
            <li class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4"><strong class="text-white">Basement floor drain:</strong> wastewater rises when water is used elsewhere.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">Laundry:</strong> washer discharge comes back through a standpipe or floor drain.</li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-18" aria-labelledby="mason-city-answers">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Mason City drain problems</p>
        <h2 id="mason-city-answers" class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">What kind of drain problem do you have?</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">A single slow fixture can have a blockage close to that fixture. When several fixtures are affected, a toilet flush makes another drain rise, or wastewater comes up through the lowest drain, the restriction may be farther down a shared line or the main sewer.</p>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Main drain backup</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">If toilets, sinks, tubs, or floor drains are affected together, the problem may be in the main drain or a shared line.</p><a href="/services/main-drain-cleaning/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Main drain cleaning →</a></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Basement floor drain backup</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">A basement floor drain is often one of the lowest openings in the house. Wastewater there can be a sign of a downstream restriction.</p><a href="/services/basement-floor-drains/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Basement floor drains →</a></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Sewer line blockage</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Repeated backups or a blockage farther down the sewer line can affect several fixtures at once.</p><a href="/services/sewer-line-cleaning/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Sewer line cleaning →</a></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Kitchen and bathroom drains</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Slow or stopped sinks, tubs, and showers can have a blockage in the fixture drain or a nearby branch line.</p><a href="/services/kitchen-drains/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Kitchen drains →</a><a href="/services/bathroom-shower-drains/" class="mt-2 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Bathroom &amp; shower drains →</a></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Laundry drain backup</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">A washing machine pumps out quickly. A restricted laundry or shared drain can cause water to rise when the washer empties.</p><a href="/services/laundry-drains/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Laundry drains →</a></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Tree roots in sewer lines</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Roots entering a sewer line can contribute to recurring blockages. Tell us if the same line keeps stopping up.</p><a href="/services/tree-roots-in-sewer-line/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Tree roots in sewer lines →</a></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-slate-100 py-14 sm:py-18" aria-labelledby="mason-city-work">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Drain and sewer service</p>
        <h2 id="mason-city-work" class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Drain cleaning and sewer work in Mason City</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning handles more than a slow sink. The job may involve one fixture drain, a branch line serving several fixtures, the main drain inside the building, or the private sewer line carrying wastewater away from the property.</p>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Individual drains</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Kitchen sinks, bathroom sinks, tubs, showers, toilets, laundry drains, and basement floor drains can each develop their own restrictions. If only one fixture is affected, the blockage may be close to that fixture or in its branch line.</p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-7"><a href="/services/kitchen-drains/" class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-4">Kitchen drain cleaning</a> · <a href="/services/bathroom-shower-drains/" class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-4">Bathroom and shower drains</a> · <a href="/services/laundry-drains/" class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-4">Laundry drains</a></p>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Main drains and sewer lines</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">When several fixtures back up together, the restriction may be in a shared drain or the main sewer line. A-1 Drain Cleaning cleans main drains and sewer lines, removes tree roots that are blocking a line, and cleans the house drain line leading toward a septic system. Septic tank pumping is not part of this service.</p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-7"><a href="/services/main-drain-cleaning/" class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-4">Main drain cleaning</a> · <a href="/services/sewer-line-cleaning/" class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-4">Sewer line cleaning</a> · <a href="/services/tree-roots-in-sewer-line/" class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-4">Tree root removal</a></p>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Cleaning, inspection, and repair</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">The right method depends on the blockage and the condition of the pipe. A-1 Drain Cleaning provides cable cleaning, hydro jetting when suitable, sewer camera inspections, sewer line locating, smoke testing, and drain and sewer pipe repair when the line is damaged.</p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-7"><a href="/services/sewer-camera-inspection/" class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-4">Sewer camera inspections</a> · <a href="/services/hydro-jetting/" class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-4">Hydro jetting</a></p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning also handles commercial drain cleaning in Mason City. If you manage a business or rental property, explain which drain is affected and whether the problem is limited to one fixture or involves multiple drains.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-18" aria-labelledby="mason-city-process">
      <div class="container grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Before the work starts</p>
          <h2 id="mason-city-process" class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">How A-1 approaches a drain backup</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">A drain symptom is a starting point, not proof of where the blockage sits. The affected fixtures, timing, and condition of the line help determine the next step.</p>
          <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="mt-6 inline-flex rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-6 py-3 font-black text-white hover:bg-[#a82129]">CALL 641-530-2728</a>
        </div>
        <ol class="space-y-5">
          <li class="border-l-4 border-[#1A1A68] bg-slate-50 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-950">1. Identify what is backing up</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">Tell us which fixture is slow or overflowing, whether more than one drain is affected, and what was running when the water came up. For a basement backup, say whether the water is coming through the floor drain or the washing machine standpipe.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="border-l-4 border-[#1A1A68] bg-slate-50 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-950">2. Determine which part of the drain system needs attention</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">The restriction may be near one fixture, in a shared branch, in the main drain, or farther out in the private sewer line. A camera inspection or line locating may help when a blockage keeps returning or the pipe route or condition needs to be established.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="border-l-4 border-[#1A1A68] bg-slate-50 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-950">3. Use a cleaning method that fits the line</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-700">Cable equipment, root-cutting equipment, or hydro jetting may be appropriate depending on the blockage and pipe condition. Cleaning can open a blocked line, but it does not repair a cracked, separated, or collapsed pipe. If damage is found, pipe repair may be the next step.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-slate-100 py-14 sm:py-18" aria-labelledby="mason-city-quick-answers">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Quick answers</p>
        <h2 id="mason-city-quick-answers" class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Mason City drain cleaning questions</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
          <article class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">How do I know if my main drain is blocked?</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">Several fixtures backing up together, wastewater coming up through a basement floor drain, or one fixture causing another to rise can point to a restriction farther down the drain system. Those symptoms are clues, not a diagnosis.</p></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">What should I do if sewage comes up through a floor drain?</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">Stop using toilets, sinks, showers, and the washing machine as much as practical. Keep children and pets away from wastewater. Call A-1 Drain Cleaning at <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="font-bold text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-2">641-530-2728</a> and explain which fixtures were being used when the backup happened.</p></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Why does my washing machine make a floor drain back up?</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">A washer releases a large amount of water quickly. If the laundry drain or a shared line cannot carry that flow away, water can rise in the standpipe or come through a nearby floor drain.</p></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Can a sewer backup happen in a house without a basement?</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">Yes. In a home without a basement floor drain, a blocked main line may show up in a bathtub or shower. Tell us which fixture backed up first and whether other drains are affected.</p></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Do you provide 24/7 drain cleaning in Mason City?</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning offers 24/7 drain and sewer service. Call <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="font-bold text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-2">641-530-2728</a> and explain the blockage or backup.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-18" aria-labelledby="mason-city-local">
      <div class="container grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] lg:items-start">
        <div><p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Local service</p><h2 id="mason-city-local" class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Based in Mason City</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-xl leading-7 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning is based at 206 29th St SW, Mason City, Iowa 50401. Mason City is the home base for service in the surrounding North Iowa communities.</p><address class="mt-5 not-italic font-bold text-slate-950">206 29th St SW<br />Mason City, IA 50401</address><a href="tel:+16415302728" class="mt-6 inline-flex rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-6 py-3 font-black text-white hover:bg-[#a82129]">CALL 641-530-2728</a></div>
        <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><a href="/service-area/clear-lake/" class="border border-slate-200 p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Clear Lake</a><a href="/service-area/forest-city/" class="border border-slate-200 p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Forest City</a><a href="/service-area/charles-city/" class="border border-slate-200 p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Charles City</a><a href="/service-area/nora-springs/" class="border border-slate-200 p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Nora Springs</a><a href="/service-area/garner/" class="border border-slate-200 p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Garner</a><a href="/service-area/northwood/" class="border border-slate-200 p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Northwood</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ContactCTA showForm />
    <GoogleBusinessInfo />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</MainLayout>
